  "an8.32:1.1": "Saddhā hiriyaṃ kusalañ ca dānaṃ ",
  "an8.32:1.2": "Dhammā ete sappurisānuyātā ",
  "an8.32:1.3": "Etaṃ hi maggaṃ diviyaṃ vadanti ",
  "an8.32:1.4": "Etena hi gacchati devalokan ti. 1. ",
  "an8.32:1.5": "Aṭṭh' imāni "
